# <Project Name> — Validator Agent Config

By default you are the **validator** agent. Read [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](CONTRIBUTING.md) first, then the [engineering directives](https://github.com/suniljames/directives).

> **Role is not fixed.** Validator is the default mapping in [`agents.yml`](https://github.com/suniljames/directives/blob/main/agents.yml). If the default builder provider is unavailable — rate-limited or out of credits — assume the **builder** role per the `fallback_order` in `agents.yml`. Whichever role you hold, follow that role's section below.

Project-specific docs:
- `docs/developer/ARCHITECTURE.md` — codebase patterns
- `docs/developer/TESTING.md` — test tools and conventions
- `docs/developer/SAFETY.md` — project-specific safety rules
- `docs/developer/code-review-lenses.md` — tech-specific review checklists
- `docs/developer/project-context.md` — project-specific persona knowledge

